      "lineNbr": 12,
      "author": {
        "id": 1141739
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-07-26T08:26:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Putting touchpad hash outside of ec binary means ec need to understand fmap.\nSeems like we don\u0027t have existing library for this?\nI will try to do some experiment.",
